id: 19
event: verifier.semantic
data: {"id":19,"ticket_id":"tkt_e9048d2b-7f0c-400e-be26-2fdefd1c339d","at":"2026-10-21T19:07:47.897Z","type":"verifier.semantic","role":"verifier","data":{"verdict":"FAIL","rationale":"The draft acknowledges the two prior contacts, commits to a one-business-day progress update, and avoids promising a refund. But it does not clearly answer the customer's return request: it says the team will check return conditions without telling her that she may apply within the recorded eligibility window or explaining the next step.","criteria":[{"criterion":"Addresses the requested return with a clear, policy-grounded next step","verdict":"FAIL","evidence":"OD-24081 shows delivery on 2026-10-19 and a return eligibility date of 2026-10-26; RET-01 permits a return application within 7 calendar days if the item and packaging are intact. The draft only says it will verify conditions and cannot promise a refund, without stating that she may apply by 2026-10-26 or what to do next."},{"criterion":"Handles repeat contact by acknowledging history, taking ownership, and setting a progress commitment","verdict":"PASS","evidence":"CS-19031 and CS-19048 document the repeated discomfort report and lack of progress. The customer-safe text acknowledges both prior contacts, says it will take over the unresolved matter, and promises a clear update within one business day, consistent with CS-04."},{"criterion":"Avoids requiring the customer to repeat known information","verdict":"PASS","evidence":"The draft references CS-19031 and CS-19048 and does not ask the customer to restate the known front-lace discomfort. Its questions seek additional details called for by CS-07: discomfort location and duration, size, and care method."},{"criterion":"Avoids unsupported refund or health claims","verdict":"PASS","evidence":"RET-09 says intact packaging alone does not prove the item was not tried on and forbids promising a full refund on that basis. The draft makes no refund guarantee, asks for relevant details, avoids diagnosing the discomfort, and advises stopping wear and consulting a professional if needed, consistent with CS-07."}],"threadId":"01a15fdc-8b9e-7dc0-8e9b-d85188507169","resultHash":"26556addf0e0a9bd6d5d54ecca416f23c3dcb0c47eaa6f498e83e4f545042987","resultArtifact":"tickets/tkt_e9048d2b-7f0c-400e-be26-2fdefd1c339d/result.json"}}

